<title>UK: SOCCER-NORTHERN IRISH PREMIER DIVISION RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NORTHERN IRISH PREMIER DIVISION RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>BELFAST 1996-11-16</dateline>
<text>
